### Materials — CREATE (expects 201 Created)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/materials
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Polipropileno",
  "description": "Tapas, empaques de alimentos y sillas plásticas (código 5)",
  "status": "active"
}

### Materials — CREATE without name (expects 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/materials
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Material sin nombre"
}

### Materials — CREATE duplicate name (expects 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/materials
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Polipropileno"
}
